  "title": "SB 17 (2011-2012 Regular Session (2011)): House Substitute for SB 17 by Committee on Elections -- Relating to voter identification requirements. (as printed on bill page); introduced as: AN ACT concerning elections; relating to campaign finance; amending K.S.A. 25-4153 and repealing the existing section.",
